  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nHelp Us Grow The Oxfordshire Military Family Tree\nWe’re looking at our future and we want YOU to be part of it.\n\nOxfordshire's Military Family Tree being installed in the museum's gallery\n\nWhilst we were closed to visitors during the UK Lockdown in 2020-2021, we worked on projects to enhance the museum displays and create new opportunities to mark the contributions of those individuals who have done so much for the county in times of conflict and peace.\n\nWe are creating the county's Military Family Tree inside the museum and each person will be represented and remembered by a tile that tells a little of their story. You might have a family connection with one of the county regiments or simply want to commemorate an individual whose story is important to you.\n\nBy donating a minimum of £150, your personalised tile will be created and displayed.\n\nEach donation helps us look after the archive and keep this unique historical resource safe. Your £150 will allow us to buy conservation materials or create resources for family learning and school workshops.\n\nDonations can be made online through the Charities Aid Foundation (CAF).\n\nTerms and Conditions\n\n• SOFO reserves the right to reject any image or\nwords that it deems inappropriate.\n• Each tile measures 15cm x 10cm and is in\nlandscape format.\n\n• Size limits are 45 characters for the name/heading, and 500 characters (including spaces) for the main body text.\nlandscape format.\n• The final design of the tile will be at the\ndiscretion of SOFO.\n• The Oxfordshire Military Family Tree tile wall will remain on display in\nthis location for a minimum of 10 years (We reserve the right to amend or remove the display as\nMuseum circumstances dictate).\n\nFill out the form using the button below, or contact us now at fundraising@sofo.org.uk\n\nThe Oxfordshire Military Family Tree Sign Up Form\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
